        "@value": "Chaos Theory Timothy Gillespie Art Show"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p>Timothy Gillespie is a Winnipeg native who produces sculptures and wall pieces in a variety of media - - including ceramics, steel, cellulose, mixed media and assemblage, including industrial elements from his South Coast Studio in Queens County, Nova Scotia. His collection of work spanning 3 decades can be viewed in this exhibit. </p>\\n"
      }
    ],
